# LogiHub — DigitalOcean App Platform Deployment Plan

> **Budget:** $200 / year (~$16.67 / month)
> **Target platform:** DigitalOcean App Platform (PaaS — similar to Render, no server management)
> **Stack:** FastAPI Backend · Next.js Frontend · Telegram Bot · PostgreSQL · Redis

---

## Why DigitalOcean App Platform (not a Droplet)?

| Feature | App Platform (PaaS) | Droplet (VPS) |
|---|---|---|
| Server management | None — DO handles it | You manage everything |
| Deploy on git push | Automatic | Manual (or CI/CD needed) |
| HTTPS / SSL | Automatic | Certbot manual setup |
| Scaling | Slider | Resize droplet |
| Closest to Render | Yes | No |
| Good for $200/yr | Yes (tight but doable) | Yes (more control) |

---

## Architecture Overview

```
Internet
   │
   ▼
DO App Platform Ingress (HTTPS auto)
   │
   ├── Frontend (Next.js)  ──► Web Service
   │
   ├── Backend (FastAPI)   ──► Web Service (handles /api, /ws)
   │
   └── Bot (Telegram)      ──► Worker Service (no HTTP port, polling)
           │
           ▼
   Supabase PostgreSQL (free tier)
   Upstash Redis         (free tier)
```

> **Key insight:** App Platform has three component types:
> - **Web Service** — has an HTTP port, gets a public URL
> - **Worker Service** — no HTTP port, runs a background process (perfect for Telegram bot)
> - **Static Site** — NOT suitable here because Next.js needs SSR

---

## Cost Breakdown (Strict $200/year Budget)

### Option A — Use Free External DB/Redis (RECOMMENDED) ✅
| Component | DO App Platform Tier | Monthly | Annual |
|---|---|---|---|
| Frontend (Next.js) | Basic Web · $5/mo | $5.00 | $60 |
| Backend (FastAPI) | Basic Web · $5/mo | $5.00 | $60 |
| Bot (Telegram) | Basic Worker · $5/mo | $5.00 | $60 |
| PostgreSQL | **Supabase free tier** (500MB) | $0 | $0 |
| Redis | **Upstash free tier** (10k cmd/day) | $0 | $0 |
| **Total** | | **$15/mo** | **$180/yr** ✅ |

### Option B — DO Managed DB (over budget by $64)
| Component | Tier | Monthly | Annual |
|---|---|---|---|
| Frontend + Backend + Bot | $5 each | $15 | $180 |
| PostgreSQL | DO Dev DB $7/mo | $7 | $84 |
| Redis | Upstash free | $0 | $0 |
| **Total** | | **$22/mo** | **$264/yr** ❌ |

> **Recommendation: Option A.** Supabase free tier is production-quality (500MB, daily backups, 7-day PITR). Upstash free is sufficient for WebSocket session caching.

