## Comparison: App Platform vs. Render

| Feature | DO App Platform | Render (what you tried) |
|---|---|---|
| Free tier | No free tier (min $5/service) | Free tier (sleeps after 15min) |
| Predictable pricing | Yes | Yes |
| Docker support | Full Dockerfile support | Full Dockerfile support |
| WebSocket | Native support | Native support |
| Worker services | Native | Native |
| Auto SSL | Yes | Yes |
| GitHub auto-deploy | Yes | Yes |
| Monthly min for 3 services | **$15** (with external DB) | **$21** (with PG, no free) |

