## Security Checklist

- [ ] All secrets as **Encrypted** env vars in App Platform (never in code or git)
- [ ] `DATABASE_URL` uses Supabase's pooler URL with SSL
- [ ] `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` uses `https://`
- [ ] CORS restricted to exact frontend domain only
- [ ] `.env` excluded from git (check `.gitignore`)
- [ ] Upstash Redis uses TLS URL (`rediss://` not `redis://`)

---

## Deployment Order Summary

```
[ ] Phase 0: Code Prep
    [ ] Verify CORS loads from env var
    [ ] Verify DATABASE_URL and REDIS_URL read from env
    [ ] Commit + push to main

[ ] Phase 1: External Services
    [ ] Create Supabase project → copy DATABASE_URL
    [ ] Create Upstash Redis → copy REDIS_URL

[ ] Phase 2: DigitalOcean App Platform
    [ ] Create new App → connect GitHub → select repo
    [ ] Add Backend Web Service → set all env vars → deploy
    [ ] Copy backend URL
    [ ] Add Frontend Web Service → set NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL → deploy
    [ ] Add Bot Worker Service → set env vars → deploy

[ ] Phase 3: Post-Deploy
    [ ] Update CORS_ORIGINS to exact frontend URL
    [ ] Verify DB migrations ran
    [ ] Test: frontend loads, login works, API responds, bot replies, WebSocket works
    [ ] Set up UptimeRobot monitors

[ ] Phase 4: Ongoing
    [ ] All future deploys: git push origin main (automatic)
```

