## FAQ

**Q: Will WebSockets work on App Platform?**
Yes. App Platform's proxy supports WebSocket upgrades natively. `/ws/dashboard` works without changes.

**Q: Next.js `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` vars are build-time — what if the backend URL changes?**
Update the env var in App Platform UI → trigger a manual redeploy of the frontend to rebuild the bundle.

**Q: Can the Telegram bot run reliably as a Worker?**
Yes. The Worker container runs continuously and is auto-restarted on crash. Polling is reliable for production at normal traffic.

**Q: What if I exceed Supabase/Upstash free limits?**
Supabase: upgrade to Pro ($25/mo) if you exceed 500MB. Upstash: upgrade to Pay-as-you-go (fractions of a cent per 10k commands). At LogiHub's expected scale, free tiers should last months.

**Q: How do I scale if I need more performance?**
App Platform: change the plan slider from Basic ($5) to Professional ($12/service) per service. No migration needed.
